1
00:00:00,630 --> 00:00:02,600
(Howard:)with you
all the way to morning.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,970
(Howard:)Unless the desert air
dries out her sinuses,

3
00:00:03,970 --> 00:00:05,250
(Howard:)in which case I'll have
to schlep out there

4
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:07,170
(Howard:)with the big humidifier.

5
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:09,370
(Bernadette:)That's it?

6
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,210
(Bernadette:)That's your big solution
to all of our problems?

7
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:14,580
(Bernadette:)If your mom's nose holds up,
we get two nights together?

8
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:16,820
(Howard:)Isn't that great?

9
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:19,070
(Bernadette:)No, it's not great.

10
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:20,320
(Bernadette:)You need to make a choice.

11
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,550
(Bernadette:)Me or your mother.

12
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:23,420
(Leonard:)Uh...

13
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:24,560
(Bernadette:)Wrong answer.

14
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:25,910
(Howard:)No, wait.

15
00:00:25,910 --> 00:00:27,280
(Howard:)You didn't let me finish.

16
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,860
(Bernadette:)I'm listening.

17
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:30,530
(Leonard:)Uh...

18
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:43,300
(Amy:)I came as quickly as I could.

19
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:45,220
(Howard:)Okay.

20
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:47,240
(Leonard:)Why?

21
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:48,930
(Amy:)To comfort you, of course.

22
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:51,760
(Amy:)Sheldon told me about Leonard
dating Rajesh's sister.

23
00:00:51,790 --> 00:00:53,250
(Amy:)So I high-tailed it over here

24
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:55,760
(Amy:)to pick up the pieces
of your broken heart.

25
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:57,860
(Penny:)Amy, I'm fine.

26
00:00:57,860 --> 00:01:01,020
(Amy:)You don't have to
be strong for me.

